  "reasoning": "The defendant sold pirated optical discs (光碟) without the permission of the copyright holders, for profit. This constitutes the illegal reproduction and distribution of copyrighted works, which under Chinese criminal law is the crime of '侵犯著作权罪' (copyright infringement). No other criminal conduct is indicated in the facts.",
